From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Remove unsupported A376B eUICC MEP declaration

Reason: finalstages77.txt:353 reports privapp-permissions-com.samsung.euicc.mep.xml
still advertises eUICC after final cleanup. S9-family target explicitly has no
embedded SIM. Extend the existing cleanup list to this actual donor file and
keep the final gate strict for either euicc or euicc.mep feature declaration.
Files: unica/patches/exynos9810_device_stack/exynos9810_finalization/customize.sh.
Verification: actual XML inspected, shell syntax, replay78 and final-tail78b
continuation; full clean build and physical SIM/IMS runtime remain required.

---
--- a/unica/patches/exynos9810_device_stack/exynos9810_finalization/customize.sh
+++ b/unica/patches/exynos9810_device_stack/exynos9810_finalization/customize.sh
@@ -1173,6 +1173,7 @@
     for REL in \
         system/etc/permissions/privapp-permissions-com.samsung.android.app.esimkeystring.xml \
         system/etc/permissions/privapp-permissions-com.samsung.euicc.xml \
+        system/etc/permissions/privapp-permissions-com.samsung.euicc.mep.xml \
         system/etc/permissions/privapp-permissions-com.samsung.android.app.telephonyui.esimclient.xml \
         system/etc/sysconfig/preinstalled-packages-com.samsung.android.app.esimkeystring.xml \
         system/etc/sysconfig/preinstalled-packages-com.samsung.euicc.xml \
@@ -1231,7 +1232,7 @@
     }
 
     while IFS= read -r -d '' PROP_XML; do
-        if grep -qE 'feature[[:space:]]+name="android\.hardware\.telephony\.euicc"' "$PROP_XML"; then
+        if grep -qE 'feature[[:space:]]+name="android\.hardware\.telephony\.euicc(\.mep)?"' "$PROP_XML"; then
             LOGE "Unsupported eSIM feature survived final cleanup: $PROP_XML"
             return 1
         fi
